  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed development, fails to make adequate\r\nprovision for secure storage of 7No. bicycles, contrary to Policy T5 of the\r\nLondon Plan, Policy 61 (Active Travel)&nbsp;and Appendix 1 – Parking standards\r\nof the&nbsp;Local Plan (2024) and London Cycle Design Standards (2014).",
    "The principle of the development is\r\nunacceptable, the existing HMO use has resulted in the loss of a single-family\r\ndwelling house, to the detriment of the supply of family housing to meet the\r\nBoroughs long-term needs contrary to Policy 20&nbsp;of the Local Plan (2024).",
    "The proposed development would result in a\r\ncramped and unsatisfactory form of living environment for existing and future\r\noccupiers failing to meet minimum space standard requirements in relation to\r\nfour of the bedrooms and the kitchen area&nbsp;contrary to Policy 20."
  ],
